title: "Ecosystem review and deep-graph enrichment pass 2026-07-27: all-status census, CLI simplification + token-efficiency + long-term brainstorm, dedupe-checked gap filing"
description: "Date+theme-identified review/organization/planning pass per decision pm-zeifd2 (never sequentially numbered), successor to closed pass pm-e9yevx. Full all-status inspection of the 2,127-item workspace; live verification of release automation, npm/bun publish state, and CI; recorded brainstorms for CLI grammar simplification (pm-n7rr), token-efficient output (pm-g3n00m/pm-5t33or), adaptive context algorithms (pm-4k6b), SDK-first completeness (pm-usfg), immutable history (pm-w7ccmv), and multi-agent scale (pm-dj98/pm-9rxu); dedupe-checked gap filing; typed-edge enrichment so the all-status graph stays traversable to outcome milestones with explainable paths (pm-bzmeaa invariant)."
