comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T07:00:45.792Z","harness:opencode","Census evidence (live): 2,127 items + this pass item = 2,128 streams; by status open 308 / closed 1,806 / canceled 13 / in_progress 1 (this item). Types: Task 641, Issue 593, Feature 389, Chore 271, Epic 87, Decision 63, Story 53, Plan 22, Milestone 7. History: 39,625 entries across 2,138 streams, drift 0/2,128. Graph: 2,130 nodes, 9,405 edges (related 4,479, implements 1,989, parent 1,952, blocked_by 385, blocks 219, discovered_from 190, verifies 133, supersedes 41, child 15, incident_from 2), 0 isolated active nodes, 0 degree<=1 active nodes. Live system: auto-release scheduled run succeeded 2026-07-27T06:05Z (v2026.7.27 on npm dist-tags.latest + GitHub release, one auto-release today); CI green on main (CodeQL, CodSpeed, Docs, OSSF, Security). Health: only warn is local merge_driver_configuration:5 (environment, not tracker data). Validate: history_drift 0; resolution backfill warning 290 (tracked by pm-e9zh/pm-wrbe). Duplicate check for this pass: pm search 'ecosystem review brainstorm organization planning pass' shows only closed pm-e9yevx (2026-07-26) as predecessor; pm duplicates shows no open cluster matching this theme."
  "2026-07-27T07:18:38.231Z","harness:opencode",warm-loop probe
  "2026-07-27T07:20:55.964Z","harness:opencode","Enrichment evidence: graph grew 9,405 -> 9,446 edges (+41) and 2,130 -> 2,132 nodes (+2: this pass, pm-rbg1qo) with zero new audit findings (11 info-level legacy findings unchanged, owned by pm-p9a4/pm-hnc9w7). Edges added: (1) 13-edge supersedes chain across all 14 historical review/audit passes 2026-06-07 pm-xm98 .. 2026-07-27 pm-89qv6b, verified traversable end-to-end via pm graph paths (13 hops); (2) implements/verifies anchors for the 5 active items that lacked them (pm-mkzw1x + pm-gjicmx -> pm-dj98, pm-0d7ord -> pm-t4d7nz, pm-hipfu9 + pm-s4y3z4 -> pm-u9d0) plus pm-a5w7vv (blocked_by pm-xp1xsw grammar freeze, implements pm-j82fd3) leaving only the roadmap root unanchored by design; (3) outcome-milestone DAG completed: pm-9rgaal blocked_by pm-j82fd3, pm-t4d7nz blocked_by pm-xp1xsw + pm-o87av6, verified multi-path from 2028-06 milestone to 2026-10 milestone; (4) RL entitlement composition: pm-nfrhf0 blocked_by pm-e96opw + pm-rbcvt2 with the four-piece composition map recorded as a note; (5) new item pm-rbg1qo (session-topic + effort/role provenance coverage) wired discovered_from this pass, implements pm-szv11n, related pm-gw6uyq/pm-oskdmu/pm-itsjf0/pm-03pq3o/pm-qwuber. Brainstorms recorded: warm steady-state token loop baseline on pm-g3n00m (4.3kB default vs ~50B disciplined per cycle; routing-not-capability finding), RL composition map on pm-nfrhf0. Not filed (deliberate): a seventh outcome milestone — pm-doxj horizons note 2026-07-26 records the ladder as fixed at six with promotion owned by pm-m08hza."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T07:19:48.769Z","harness:opencode","Review-pass economics: on a mature tracker the highest-value moves are compositional, not additive. This pass filed exactly one new item (pm-rbg1qo) because search-first duplicate checking against 2,127 items showed the CLI-simplification, token-efficiency, scale, immutability, multi-agent and CI themes were all already owned; the genuine work was wiring — a 14-node supersedes chain across every historical review pass, implements/verifies anchors for the six items that lacked them, blocked_by completion of the outcome-milestone DAG, and composition maps (RL entitlement, warm token loop) recorded on the stories that bind the primitives. A pass that creates many items on a mature map is usually a sign the search step was skipped."
